#: memory.cpp:102
msgid ""
"This display shows you the current memory usage of your system. The values "
"are updated on a regular basis and give you an overview of the physical and "
"virtual memory being used."
msgstr ""
"Cist håynaedje la mostere l' eployaedje do moumint del memwere di vosse "
"sistinme. Les valixhances sont sovint metowes a djoû eyet vs dinèt ene vuwe "
"djeneråle del memwere fizike eyet forveyowe k' est eployeye."

